ok: ACTORS names the actor type under --hot-reload
ok: EPOCHS lists the dispatch slot
ok: TOP names a supervised child's supervisor by pid and type
ok: TOP gives the supervisor's policy: rest_for_one, 3 within 30, 1 child
ok: TOP leaves parent_type null for an unsupervised actor
ok: TOP stack ranks the deep-recursion actor first, over the 64 KiB floor
ok: no reply carries the crash message
